---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section id="top" class="photo-hero">
  <div class="hero-photo" style={`background-image: url('${base}/images/honeyguide-hero.png')`}>
    <div class="hero-veil"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1 class="hero-serif-title" data-en="Technology for<br>Interspecies Understanding" data-zh="面向跨物种<br>交流的技术">Technology for<br>Interspecies Understanding</h1>
    <div class="hero-body">
      <p data-en="In Mozambique, honeyguide birds lead humans to beehives — and share the honey. A protocol between species with no shared language." data-zh="在莫桑比克，响蜜鴷引领人类找到蜂巢——并分享蜂蜜。一种无需共同语言的跨物种协议。">In Mozambique, honeyguide birds lead humans to beehives — and share the honey. A protocol between species with no shared language.</p>
      <p data-en="<strong>Cross-species communication works — it just never scaled.</strong>" data-zh="<strong>跨物种交流始终有效——只是从未规模化。</strong>"><strong>Cross-species communication works — it just never scaled.</strong></p>
      <p data-en="<strong>That changes now.</strong> We build open tools to listen — and respond." data-zh="<strong>现在，这一切正在改变。</strong>我们构建开源工具，去倾听——并回应。"><strong>That changes now.</strong> We build open tools to listen — and respond.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-cta-row">
      <a href="#cases" class="hero-cta-outline"><span data-en="Explore Cases" data-zh="探索案例">Explore Cases</span>
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Seeed-Solution/Open-Datalogger-For-Interspecies/tree/main" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hero-cta-solid"><span data-en="Launch Open Datalogger" data-zh="启动 Open Datalogger">Launch Open Datalogger</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a href="#why" class="hero-scroll">
    <span data-en="Scroll" data-zh="向下滚动">Scroll</span>
    <svg class="w-4 h-4 animate-bounce" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
  </a>
</section>
